                <pb facs="0928" n="808" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg808"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.51/3955: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Schurman</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-09-01T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 1,
                                1922—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>209. Your 353, August 29, 1 p.m.</p>
                <p>Department fails to understand why Chinese Government is able to pay $600,000
                    interest on loan mentioned and does not make an interest payment on the several
                    defaulted American obligations. You may so inform Chinese Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
